{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "5_02_010_22",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:48038dfb6faf281efc83c8f67d0cacbfc60ec3173a5e85a83a9e57f16dd9622f",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:5_02_010_22:5_02_010_22_a:cmd-000015:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a7ee7bc10d35eb14f77f203f945e8f6c36dda77731b1c898071f6ab55041572e",
      "text": "训练课，辛苦了——！\n●●●●プロデューサー。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_010_22:5_02_010_22_a:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2c38a0870d0bd98494cc03de232178745c2d4d414838a8031a569533d9b1afc7",
      "text": "白色情人节快乐！\n这个，请收下！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_010_22:5_02_010_22_a:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ea60bf3dbedb17ad7c62b3db9eb6983adac5137f0f2aa761e2fe776780ed3997",
      "text": "情人节巧克力，谢谢。\n甜甜的超级好吃！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_010_22:5_02_010_22_a:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f95a887a639883d7f2091eb8912c347409e409cbab9f60e36392a7e459319018",
      "text": "回礼，我有很努力地挑选哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_010_22:5_02_010_22_a:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9052fe9e241487b616a5c768cf07a900e19e9ee7d74fc47000dcabe1c633bdbd",
      "text": "制作人要是喜欢的话，\n我会超级、开心的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_010_22:5_02_010_22_b:cmd-000013:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ec09718f86e53c0167f61b09fa0cc723c9e1471212cd2bba2af044fc78b47105",
      "text": "呱呱～♪ 白色情人节快乐！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_010_22:5_02_010_22_b:cmd-000019:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:073ba1d14c2cec361168bb808b5732b78aedac9896a79bcfcdb97386943d4b0d",
      "text": "那个呢，从●●●●プロデューサー那里，\n收到情人节巧克力，我好开心。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_010_22:5_02_010_22_b:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4d96fb8bbc690ef283540586a3d5277b0130a5f99f91d9b59f698218a9c5bc13",
      "text": "心里，暖烘烘的，好幸福！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_010_22:5_02_010_22_b:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:67090ff186719968921855c33486bc9aca7aceb4d8c269a66c9d295eb3427e5e",
      "text": "我也希望●●●●プロデューサー的心里，\n变得暖烘烘的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_010_22:5_02_010_22_b:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:41d9db25c9b1ae25ee0b634d4ce1d75a8e32f8b1bf7262b43570c99d9abd0421",
      "text": "希望你能露出很多很多的笑容！所以，\n倾注了我满满心意的回礼。准备好了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_010_22:5_02_010_22_b:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3e30cf3845ede3f7f6a6cf8cefecede14e65e424558ba7f762c4cc4f290fed3b",
      "text": "制作人。\n请收下！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_010_22:5_02_010_22_b:cmd-000041:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:20652153ead15d015ba20b940090ff510f5e2acbc866fbfc32adeb62349c188a",
      "text": "非常感谢。我很开心！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_010_22:5_02_010_22_b:cmd-000042:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:732453d0cd2de4890fda25f9e1533845213a193798ee5a6547af29afad5b2a70",
      "text": "我的心也变得暖洋洋的了。非常感谢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_010_22:5_02_010_22_b:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:172f2765639820f872ba93973c3b6297a796d380a8fd6ae82208bf928450f835",
      "text": "嘿嘿，能让你高兴，太好啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_010_22:5_02_010_22_b:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:649ff26f4cdd539d06a05d746f615ae6440b9303bafe37e8fb62699bb83541f2",
      "text": "要是●●●●プロデューサー能喜欢的话，\n我会更高兴的♪",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
